Are you a good chess player?
你象棋下得好吗？

1657
01:24:33.510 --> 01:24:33.710
Yeah.
还可以。

1658
01:24:33.910 --> 01:24:35.270
Hey, Credo, how's it going?
嘿，克里多，最近怎么样？

1659
01:24:35.430 --> 01:24:37.550
Listen, I left some limes on your porch.
听着，我在你家门廊放了一些青柠。

1660
01:24:37.550 --> 01:24:38.970
Also, can you play chess?
还有，你会下象棋吗？

1661
01:24:39.290 --> 01:24:40.010
I know.
我知道。

1662
01:24:40.150 --> 01:24:41.770
Pete, there must be like, what is happening?
皮特，这一定像是，到底发生了什么？

1663
01:24:42.250 --> 01:24:48.110
And finally, thank you to Brent Forrester, our longtime writer on The Office, who also directed this episode.
最后，感谢布伦特·福雷斯特，他是我们《办公室》的老牌编剧，也执导了这一集。

1664
